translation_D:
Quietly and deeply contemplating, thoughts connecting with a thousand generations;  
Quietly moving with emotion, gaze penetrating ten thousand miles.  
In the midst of chanting and singing, exhaling and inhaling the sound of pearls and jade;  
Before the eyebrows, rolling out and retracting the colors of wind and clouds.  
When climbing a mountain, emotions are filled by the mountain;  
When gazing at the sea, thoughts overflow into the sea.  
How great my talent is, I shall soon ride the winds and clouds together.
